---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About Lérins AI">
  <main class="bg-slate-50 px-4 py-16">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-lg sm:p-12">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600">About the product</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold text-blue-700">A helpful AI assistant for your website</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-700"><strong class="text-blue-600">Lérins AI</strong> is a lightweight plugin for small business websites. It answers customer questions about your products, services, pricing, policies, and availability while you get on with running the business.</p>
      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold text-blue-600">What Lérins AI handles</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-slate-700">
        <li><strong>Everyday questions:</strong> Give visitors immediate answers about opening hours, delivery, services, stock, and next steps.</li>
        <li><strong>Product guidance:</strong> Help customers compare options, find suitable products, and make confident purchase decisions.</li>
        <li><strong>Support handoff:</strong> Collect the important details and open a support ticket when a question needs a human response.</li>
        <li><strong>Always available:</strong> Keep helpful answers running after hours, on weekends, and during busy periods.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold text-blue-600">Built for small businesses</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700">You do not need a large support team or a complicated platform. Add one script to your existing website, give Lérins AI your business knowledge, and let it handle the first conversation with each visitor.</p>
      <p class="mt-6 rounded border-l-4 border-blue-400 bg-blue-50 p-4 font-semibold text-blue-800">The goal is simple: fewer repetitive questions for you, faster answers for your customers, and more conversations that lead somewhere useful.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
